    "m_FunctionSourceUsePragmas": true,
    "m_FunctionBody": "float sdf = distance(Position, UV) - Radius;\nfloat circle = 1 - saturate(sdf / fwidth(sdf));\n\nfloat2 gradientDir = float2(cos(Radians),-sin(Radians));\nfloat gradientVal = saturate(dot(UV - Position, gradientDir) / Radius / 2 + 0.5);\n\nfloat4 gradient = lerp(Color1, Color2, gradientVal);\n\n\nRGBA = (gradient * circle);\n"
